  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato and capsicum into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place sweet potato and capsicum on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. Allow to cool slightly. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the sweet potato between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67cea23dfc617b70a129fdcb-f9177fe8.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, using a vegetable peeler, peel cucumber into ribbons.\n• Slice lemon into wedges.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Drain and rinse chickpeas.\n• In a small bowl, combine harissa paste and Greek-style yoghurt. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67cea23dfc617b70a129fdcb-cca9e108.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the sweet potato is cooling, in a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook chickpeas, tossing, until tender, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add the butter, paprika spice blend, garlic and a pinch of chilli flakes (if using), then cook until fragrant and slightly charred, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67cea23dfc617b70a129fdcb-32ed83e3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine the honey, a good squeeze of lemon juice, a drizzle of olive oil and a pinch of salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67cea23dfc617b70a129fdcb-dba1d15a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the dressing, add roasted sweet potato, capsicum, spinach & rocket mix and cucumber. Toss to combine and season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67cea23dfc617b70a129fdcb-4d497f68.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide sweet potato salad between bowls, then top with spiced chickpeas.\n• Drizzle with harissa yoghurt and crumble over marinated goat cheese to garnish.\n• Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67cea23dfc617b70a129fdcb-2123231d.jpeg"
    }
  ]
